1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,107
Start with the experiment document: learning, recall practice, assessment and Replay all begin on this one page
第一次使用，先打开这份实验文档；学习、回忆训练、检验和 Replay 都从这一页进入

2
00:00:08,705 --> 00:00:15,055
First get to know the lab scene: drag to rotate the three-dimensional bench, scroll to zoom in on each instrument
第一步先熟悉实验场景：按住拖动可以旋转视角，滚轮能放大看清每件器材

3
00:00:16,653 --> 00:00:22,243
Unsure about a step, hit Watch Demo and the animation plays that whole step for you
不确定怎么操作时，点观看演示，动画会把当前这一步完整做一遍

4
00:00:23,841 --> 00:00:29,751
Back on the flow map, hit Expand Learning to break one root block into stages and then concrete steps
回到流程图，点展开学习，把总块逐层拆成阶段和具体步骤

5
00:00:31,349 --> 00:00:37,819
Open any node and the right panel shows the action, the reason, the check point and the source passage
不确定某个节点时点开它，右边会给出操作、原因、检查点和原文来源

6
00:00:39,417 --> 00:00:43,527
Select a node and ask, the answer stays in the conversation on the right
还有疑问就选中节点直接提问，回答会留在右侧的对话里

7
00:00:45,125 --> 00:00:50,478
Move on to recall practice, where step names are hidden and you fill them back onto the map
学完就练：进入回忆训练，把被藏掉的步骤名称在图上补回来

8
00:00:52,076 --> 00:00:57,906
Hit Check Answer and the interface gives only a verdict, it never reveals the answer itself
填好点检查答案，界面只给判定，不会直接把答案跳出来

9
00:00:59,504 --> 00:01:03,694
When stuck, request a hint, the right side opens one direction
卡住了就请求提示，右侧会展开一条思考方向

10
00:01:05,292 --> 00:01:11,701
Try order rebuild next, reconnect the scattered nodes into dependencies and align the canvas in one click
再用顺序重建练一遍：把打散的节点连回依赖关系，画布一键排齐

11
00:01:13,299 --> 00:01:17,874
Hit Next Question and the blanks redistribute while the prompt set changes with them
点换一题，空白节点会重新分布，题目也换了一批

12
00:01:19,472 --> 00:01:26,180
Finally take the assessment, collapse the help and write your judgement and the missing evidence as one answer
最后进检验：收起帮助，把自己的判断和缺的证据写成一段话

13
00:01:27,778 --> 00:01:33,448
After submitting, the interface moves into review and marks who provided the evaluation
提交后界面进入检查，评价由谁给出会一起标明

14
00:01:35,046 --> 00:01:42,140
Open detailed feedback and every comment refers to one sentence, with a category and a revision suggestion
点详细点评，每一条都对着原句，给出类别和修订建议

15
00:01:43,738 --> 00:01:49,948
Later during the experiment, switch to Replay, follow the steps and the notes stay attached to the current node
之后做实验时切到 Replay，照着步骤走，笔记就记在当前节点上

16
00:01:51,546 --> 00:01:56,376
Switch to the optics experiment, the flow map starts from the same root block
换到光学实验也是同一套：流程图从同一个总块开始

17
00:01:57,974 --> 00:02:03,289
Open the optics lab scene, the simulator solves the spectrum and correlation planes
打开光学实验场景，仿真器算出频谱面和相关平面

18
00:02:04,887 --> 00:02:09,897
Ask the study partner on the right whenever you need it, it answers against your own experiment
有不懂的随时问右侧的学习伙伴，它会对着你的实验回答
